WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.510
In a world… where screenshots explain nothing…

00:00:04.533 --> 00:00:06.593
one app dares to point.

00:00:08.733 --> 00:00:10.133
Meet Snapper.

00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:13.360
It lives in your menu bar. And waits.

00:00:13.667 --> 00:00:16.703
One shortcut. Drag. Snap.

00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:20.550
Box the number. Point at the peak.

00:00:21.267 --> 00:00:25.123
Hide what's private. And zoom in on what matters.

00:00:25.433 --> 00:00:26.453
Frame it.

00:00:27.933 --> 00:00:29.693
Click. Link copied.

00:00:31.533 --> 00:00:35.287
Paste it anywhere. And watch the questions stop.

00:00:35.067 --> 00:00:38.460
Need motion? Record. Trim. Send.

00:00:41.667 --> 00:00:45.080
Snapper. Screenshots that make the point.
